Subject: [PATCH v2 2/2] Bluetooth: btmrvl: add public address configuration support
Date: Fri, 18 Jul 2014 14:47:07 -0700
Message-ID: <1405720027-28676-2-git-send-email-bzhao@marvell.com>
In-Reply-To: <1405720027-28676-1-git-send-email-bzhao@marvell.com>
References: <1405720027-28676-1-git-send-email-bzhao@marvell.com>
